{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/i107q5of","slideIndex":4,"text":"§6.5.5 and §9.3. Interval on the +5.0 pp gap is [+1.5, +8.5] percentage points. Do not say GRPO beats PPO. Do not say the methods are equivalent. Holm family p = 0.25 belongs to audit H7, not to this gap. Both contrasts can show a sign-flip p of 0.0625 because five pairs agreed.\nBudget source: platform_hybrid/experiments/results/samestack_gsm8k_cot.json and samestack_gsm8k_cot_full.json. GRPO 8 prompts times 8 completions, PPO 64 prompts times 1, 64 generations per step. This equalizes generations, not prompt exposure or actual token compute."}
