{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/8f2psfyx","slideIndex":11,"text":"Close on delivered implementation and the strongest bounded finding: +5.0 percentage points against an untuned PPO baseline in five paired seeds. The exact sign-flip p-value is 0.0625, and prompt exposure differs. The next work is a tuned, exposure-matched, larger paired study. Invite questions without adding a new result."}